  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 1st level, a cantor has learned to infuse her music with the strength of her belief. If a cantor's Wisdom modifier is greater than her Charisma modifier, she adds her Wisdom modifier instead of her Charisma modifier to her ranks in the Perform skill to calculate her skill modifier.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/cantor#toc8\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
